					<description>&lt;p&gt;The DeBary Hydrogen Production Storage System, part of the DeBary power plant complex, is the winner of POWER's Top Plant Award for hydrogen. It is the first facility in the U.S. to produce, store, and burn 100% green hydrogen for power generation. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The post &lt;a href="https://www.powermag.com/a-greener-grid-florida-facility-turning-hydrogen-into-power/"&gt;A Greener Grid: Florida Facility Turning Hydrogen into Power&lt;/a&gt; appeared first on &lt;a href="https://www.powermag.com"&gt;POWER Magazine&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
